  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To find the total price after tax, we apply a $7.75%$ increase to the original price.\n\nIncreasing by $7.75%$ means that we must apply a new percentage of\n\n$$\n100%+7.75%=107.75%=1.0775\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply the original price by $1.0775:$\n\n$$\n64\\times 1.0775=68.96.\n$$\n\nSo, the total price of the backpack after tax is $$68.96.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
